-- The parity subject: a predicate hop, a gamma over a fiber in effect position, a fiber image
-- in a predicate, a spawn, a standing rule and a query, all in one program. Enabling the trace
-- must change none of it — not a value, not a row, not the query output, not the exit code.
--! registry parity-world
--! expect-n 8
--! expect gold = 6 110 4 8 102 0 0 0
--! expect tally = 109 0 0 7 0 0 0 0
--! expect reach = 1 0 0 1 0 0 0 0

Nord & mentor.Dead , Gold += 100
Lead , Tally = max/ targets'.Gold
|/ targets'.Rich , Reach += 1
Lead , spawn Recruit
def settle = Nord => Gold += 1
+/ Gold
